<title>UK: Williams sees 11 pct rise in 1996 profit.</title>
<headline>Williams sees 11 pct rise in 1996 profit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Williams Holdings Plc announced the following annual results forecast in tandem with its 1.3 billion stg recommended bid for fellow lockmaker Chubb Security Plc --</p>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) adjusted   24.1		   vs up eight pct</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 9.25		   vs 8.75</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 15.05		  vs 14.25</p>
<p> Pretax		     243		    vs 219.3</p>
<p> Exceptional profit     97		     vs 9.0</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
